---
import SectionHR from "./SectionHR.astro";
---

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10rem 0;

    .bio-heading {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .15em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .bio-paragraph {
      font-size: 1rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .bio-link {
      color: var(--gold);
      transition: color 0.25s ease-in-out;
      padding: .25rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
  }
</style> 

<section class="content-container about" id="about">
  <div class="bio-heading">
    <SectionHR />
    <h2 class="inter-200">bio</h2>
  </div>
  <p class=" bio-paragraph">
    I was born in Michigan’s Upper Peninsula and my upbringing was split between the U.P. and Denver, Colorado. After discovering programming in my early twenties, I’ve spent nearly a decade working as a professional web developer.</p>
  <p class=" bio-paragraph">
    My experience spans front-end application development, UI/UX design, interactive experiences, API and server-side engineering, as well as networking and Linux systems. I enjoy building thoughtful, performant applications and exploring how design and engineering intersect to create engaging user experiences.</p>
  <p class="bio-paragraph">
    Outside of work, I spend my time kayaking, fishing, working on my car and Jeep, and diving into all kinds of hands-on projects and crafts. At home, I’m kept busy by a crew of nine cats, three dogs, and a rabbit.
  </p>
  <p class=" bio-paragraph">
    Currently, I develop web applications at<a class="bio-link" href="https://www.tilt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tilt</a>.
  </p>
</section>
